  "description": "A solid build starts with the frameset. Want to build the X your way? Well now is your chance.\n\nWhat's included?\n\nX Frame with Thru-Axle Dropouts\n\nThru-Axle Full Carbon Fork\n\nFront and Rear Thru-Axles\n\nHeadset\n\nSeatpost Clamp\n\nStem Not Included\n\nSpecs\n\n6061 double heat-treated aluminum frame (lifetime warranty)\n\nFull-carbon thru-axle fork\n\nTapered 1 1/2 to 1 1/8\n\n400 mm axle to crown measurement\n\nIntegrated Headset (sealed cartridge bearings)\n\nUses a 68 BSA bottom bracket\n\nTire clearance is roughly 700 x 40-42 but some customers have fit 700 x 45. (Tire/rim combos vary).\n\nThru-axle dropouts\n\n12 x 100 front and 12 x 142 mm thru-axles (included)",
